[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7563.189, "timestamp": "02:06:03", "text": "下着雨，我的屁股都湿透了。 那个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7567.27, "timestamp": "02:06:07", "text": "地方。 是的，晚上我们要去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7570.79, "timestamp": "02:06:10", "text": "那里，睡在地上。 哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7574.149, "timestamp": "02:06:14", "text": "如果一些蚱蜢来了怎么办？ 哦，是啊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7577.35, "timestamp": "02:06:17", "text": "，夏天到了。 也许有一天吧。 总有一天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7582.07, "timestamp": "02:06:22", "text": "。 所以总有一天我会再次来到这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7585.91, "timestamp": "02:06:25", "text": "我想和你们一起看星星，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7589.189, "timestamp": "02:06:29", "text": "总有一天我会实现这个愿望的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7593.109, "timestamp": "02:06:33", "text": "当然。 观星很有趣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7594.802, "timestamp": "02:06:34", "text": "我们可以把这些点联系起来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7595.99, "timestamp": "02:06:35", "text": "[笑声]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7598.39, "timestamp": "02:06:38", "text": "我们可以把星星连起来之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7601.109, "timestamp": "02:06:41", "text": "类的。 真好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7603.43, "timestamp": "02:06:43", "text": "你们应该去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7606.87, "timestamp": "02:06:46", "text": "地面区域。 我的意思是，如果灰尘太大，就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7608.87, "timestamp": "02:06:48", "text": "别去了。 但如果地面像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7611.83, "timestamp": "02:06:51", "text": "这样，呃，不是像这样，呃，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7615.35, "timestamp": "02:06:55", "text": "湿的，而是呃，稳定稳定，不是湿的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7619.43, "timestamp": "02:06:59", "text": "，嗯等等。 是的，你应该"}]